e company.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> Visitors have to find the hotel doctor.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>13</span> 13. The tour guide says the tap water</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-13' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='13'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> contains no mineral.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> is unsafe.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> has an unusual taste.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>14</span> 14. What point is made about bottled water?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-14' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='14'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> It is expensive.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> The bottle is not always sealed.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> It isn't sold everywhere.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>15</span> 15. What feature is mentioned about the bus on the island?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-15' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='15'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> frequent</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> not punctual</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> not comfortable</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>16</span> 16. How can visitors know the destination of the bus on the island?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-16' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='16'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> find it in front of the bus</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> check it with the driver</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> find it at the bus stop</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>17</span> 17. What does the tour guide advise visitors to do before renting a car?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-17' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='17'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> find a taxi company</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value=